# Change: libshpool/src/daemon/server.rs, libshpool/src/daemon/shell.rs and
#   shpool/tests/regression.rs. Gives the heartbeat ack channel one buffered
#   slot instead of a rendezvous and tags each heartbeat with a request id, so
#   an ack abandoned by a timed-out heartbeat is discarded on the next pass
#   rather than wedging the shell->client thread. Adds a regression test.
#
